# The anticipatory API image needs only its locked Python project and entrypoint.
# Keep this as an allowlist so local models, datasets, evidence, and generated
# media can never inflate or leak into the remote Cloud Build context.
**
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!src/
!src/**
!deploy/
!deploy/gke_anticipatory/
!deploy/gke_anticipatory/Dockerfile
!deploy/gke_anticipatory/app.py
